@startuml kairos-kgroup-meeting-attendance-sequence
title K-Group Meeting Attendance Tracker

actor "K-Group Leader" as Leader
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Leader -> WebAdmin: Schedule / open K-Group Meeting
WebAdmin -> API: POST /kgroups/{id}/meetings or GET existing
API -> DB: INSERT or SELECT meeting
DB --> API: meetingId
API --> WebAdmin: 200/201

Leader -> WebAdmin: Mark members present/absent\nClick "Save"
WebAdmin -> API: POST /kgroups/meetings/{meetingId}/attendance {entries}
API -> DB: UPSERT KGroupAttendance
DB --> API: OK
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK

@enduml
